* `det_globalFrob_eq_absNorm_of_tateFrame` (PROVEN later on 2026-07-27 —
  the residue of
  the above after the ARITHMETIC half was stripped off on 2026-07-27:
  `det (τ (Frob_v)) = N v` away from a finite set of places, with the
